WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.233
Okay!

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:11.400
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.000
A.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.633
Eye,

00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:13.267
B.

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:13.900
Ear,

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:14.533
C.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:15.167
Nose,

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:16.433
or D.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.067
Hat?

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:18.333
Five seconds!

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.300
TIME'S UP!

00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:27.133
The answer is...

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:27.500
D,

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:27.900
hat!

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:28.667
An eye,

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:29.033
ear,

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:31.367
and nose are all parts of

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:32.133
your body.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:34.433
A hat is something you wear,

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.367
so it does not belong.

00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:38.500
Here's one,

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.967
a picture puzzle!

00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:42.400
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:42.900
A.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.367
A filled circle,

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:44.867
B.

00:00:44.867 --> 00:00:46.333
A filled square,

00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:46.800
C.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.267
An empty square,

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:49.267
or D.

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:50.733
A filled triangle?

00:00:50.733 --> 00:00:51.700
Five seconds!

00:00:57.467 --> 00:00:58.667
TIME'S UP!

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:00.500
The answer is...

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:00.867
B,

00:01:00.867 --> 00:01:02.033
a filled square!

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:04.333
The rule is the shape gets

00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:06.667
filled in but stays the same

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:07.033
shape,

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:09.367
so the empty square becomes a

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:10.133
filled square.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.600
Here's one,

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:14.567
a number series!

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:15.200
Three,

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:15.867
five,

00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:16.533
nine,

00:01:16.533 --> 00:01:17.167
fifteen,

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:17.833
twenty-three,

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:19.133
and then...

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:21.100
what comes next?

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:21.733
A.

00:01:21.733 --> 00:01:22.400
Thirty-one,

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.033
B.

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:23.700
Thirty-two,

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:24.333
C.

00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:25.000
Thirty-five,

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.300
or D.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:26.967
Thirty-three?

00:01:26.967 --> 00:01:28.267
Five seconds!

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:35.233
TIME'S UP!

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.567
The answer is...

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:38.100
D,

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:38.667
thirty-three!

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:41.433
The gaps grow by two:

00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:42.533
plus two,

00:01:42.533 --> 00:01:43.100
four,

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:43.633
six,

00:01:43.633 --> 00:01:44.200
eight,

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.867
then plus ten.

00:01:45.867 --> 00:01:49.167
So twenty-three plus ten is thirty-three.

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:50.733
So,

00:01:50.733 --> 00:01:52.767
are you smart or fart?

00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:55.200
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:56.400
find your rank!

00:01:57.567 --> 00:01:57.900
So,

00:01:57.900 --> 00:01:59.300
how did you do?

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.667
Comment your score below,

00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:02.033
and follow for more!
